          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP521 - Nampa&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A quick drive by for #5 today.  I also picked up the cap at this location.  We had hoped to be here earlier, but after last night's rains in the area, the company roads we had to go on today to get to the rigs east of PR were in really bad shape - we only had to be pulled out once!  TFTH&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
