          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP521 Nampa

Posted: N56° 01.841 W117° 07.970

GPSr: N56° 01.842 W117° 07.970&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today's leg was to drive from High Level to Slave Lake.  Apparently there were also a few caps along the way, but of course that did not have anything to do with our chosen route.  After a nice lunch in Peace River we arrived at this quick drive-up cap with a bonus cache very close by.  Thanks for the cap OFTH!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
